eight=\"96\" alt=\"Forest Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/SrhObyPX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-thevoiddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/thevoiddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"The Void Dimension\"></a>\n</p>",
